      "writtenOn": "2025-07-28T04:36:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When I add this guard, I get a segfault. Is there a reason to check beyond the type for f16?: \n```\nif (config.subgroup_broadcast_f16) {\n                            auto* vec_ty \u003d builtin-\u003eResult()-\u003eType()-\u003eAs\u003ccore::type::Vector\u003e();\n                            if (!(vec_ty-\u003eWidth() \u003e 1) || vec_ty-\u003eType()-\u003eIs\u003ccore::type::F16\u003e()) {\n                                worklist.Push(builtin);\n                            }\n                        }\n```",
