      "writtenOn": "2025-07-28T13:20:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This will match all subgroupBroadcast calls but you only want to do f16. It is merely an optimization to avoid adding them to the list if they are not a polyfill target. This optimization is a pattern done elsewhere. It likely does not matter much.",
      "parentUuid": "21b7e3e0_188bdcb0",
      "range": {
