      "writtenOn": "2025-07-28T13:45:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m guessing you get a segv because `vec_ty` is a nullptr. The `As` cast can return a nullptr if the thing being casted isn\u0027t a vector. You probably want to check something like:\n\n```\nif (builtin-\u003eResult()-\u003eType()-DeepestElement()-\u003eIs\u003ccore::type::F16\u003e();\n```\n\nThat will return true for `f16`, `vecN\u003cf16\u003e`, `array\u003cf16, N\u003e`, `array\u003cf16\u003e` or `matCxR\u003cf16\u003e`.",
